  "answer": "The conditions required for password cracking include:\n\n1. **Computational Resources**: A powerful computer with sufficient CPU, RAM, and hard drive space is necessary. The exact requirements depend on the size of the brute force job and the time needed for completion. In some cases, grid or distributed computing may be required for larger tasks [Source 2].\n\n2. **Skills**: The skill level required is low, as brute force attacks are straightforward. There are many password cracking tools available that can facilitate this process [Source 2]. \n\nThese conditions are essential for effectively executing a brute force password cracking attack.",
